flowchart LR
    A[Source video and budget] --> B[Probe and measure features]
    B --> C{Rule or Ark decision}
    C --> D[Validate preset and AQ]
    D --> E[FFmpeg two-pass encode]
    E --> F{MP4 within budget?}
    F -- No --> G[Reduce video bitrate]
    G --> C
    F -- Yes --> H[Decode and check alignment]
    H --> I[Measure PSNR and MS-SSIM]
    I --> J[Accept and record]
